  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADDITIONAL FINANCING FOOD SECURITY AND SEED IMPORTS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the project are: (i) to increase domestic food production and reduce the loss of livestock to help at least 55,000 poorest households; (ii) to improve the ability of poor households to deal with seed shortages due to poor crops; and (iii) to promote private commercial farming in order to increase food production and diversification.</narrative>
  </description>
